# ---- Site URL (OPTIONAL — the site loads fine without it) ----
#
# Only affects: <link rel="canonical">, OpenGraph URLs, sitemap.xml,
# robots.txt sitemap line. The site, terminal, IDE, every route still works
# without setting this.
#
# Resolution order in src/lib/site.ts:
#   1. NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL  (this var)
#   2. NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_URL or VERCEL_URL (auto-set on Vercel)
#   3. http://localhost:3000  (last-resort fallback)
#
# When to set this:
# - Vercel + you want a custom domain to be canonical:
#     NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com
# - Anywhere else (Netlify, Cloudflare, Render, self-host):
#     set this to your real public URL so OG/sitemap use it.
#
# Example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://hassan.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
